PewterCity_Mart_Text_BoughtWeirdFishFromShadyGuy::
    .string "A man by the water talked me into\n"
    .string "a STUB.\p"
    .string "¥500. It does one thing and the\n"
    .string "one thing does nothing.$"

PewterCity_Mart_Text_GoodThingsIfRaiseMonsDiligently::
    .string "Keep at it and even a STUB turns\n"
    .string "into something.\p"
    .string "That is what they tell me.$"


PewterCity_Mart_Text_CollectorLooked::
    .string "Every REPO has the same shelves.\p"
    .string "CALLOW's has one thing more. A thing\n"
    .string "for the INDEX, with no price on it,\l"
    .string "if you know which bin.\p"
    .string "I went twice. I never saw it.$"

PewterCity_Mart_Text_CollectorTooLate::
    .string "I went back to CALLOW's REPO.\p"
    .string "The bin is just a bin now. Somebody\n"
    .string "got there first.$"
